# Local-only Makefile variables. NOT checked into git.
#
# Copy this file to Makefile.var and fill in your own values. The main Makefile
# does `include Makefile.var` (no leading dash) so it is REQUIRED — make will
# error out until you create one. This is intentional: missing config should
# fail loudly, not silently produce wrong commands.
#
# Add new variables here when you want a Makefile target to reference something
# machine- or secret-specific (hosts, IPs, tokens, paths). Each variable should
# be documented with a one-line comment so the next person knows what to put.

# Host:port where a remote xumret server is running. Used by targets that talk
# to (or deploy to) that instance.
REMOTE_ADDR = 127.0.0.1:8080
